{
  "advisory": "Advisory triage aid for quality and regulatory review; not medical advice; nothing is filed with FDA.",
  "authentication": {
    "headers": [
      "X-API-Key",
      "Authorization: Bearer <key>"
    ],
    "note": "Read-only key. Never send a key in the URL.",
    "type": "api-key"
  },
  "description": "Read-only MaudeSignal tools over openFDA device data. Speak the text content; every fact in structuredContent has an openFDA or record link. Sentences listed under withheld were not verified: never state them as fact. Advisory triage aid for quality and regulatory review; not medical advice; nothing is filed with FDA.",
